  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the iron teppan to 400 degrees Fahrenheit",
    "In a blender, combine passion fruit pulp, olive oil, garlic, ginger, aji amarillo pepper, salt, black pepper, and cumin, and blend until smooth",
    "Place the pork roast in the iron teppan and brush the passion fruit mixture all over the roast",
    "Roast the pork for 20 minutes per pound, or until it reaches an internal temperature of 145 degrees Fahrenheit",
    "Let the pork rest for 10 minutes before slicing and serving",
    "Slice the pork into thick slices and serve with the accumulated juices",
    "Garnish with fresh cilantro and serve immediately"
  ],
